{"schema":"rebang.page/1","platform":"jike","key":"h-310821531c","built_at":"2026-11-28T02:11:12+08:00","blogger_revision":"6fc0638e42f0427c7422e89cfe1bfe4605e832c6a8261b8e1838a853dbc5d14d","page":1,"pages":1,"total":10,"has_more":false,"items":[{"id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b0868f738389f5993fe5b45","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","source_name":"少楠Plidezus","title":"","summary":"明年就是来杭州的第十年了。 做这个产品的时候，感觉像是给杭州的一封情书。 每个路线，每个地标，都曾经留下过很多回忆。 也偏心的加上了毛家埠，于谦祠，黛色参天。还有杭州特有的鸟叫，植物。 还有历史中，那些人，那些事。","body":"明年就是来杭州的第十年了。\n\n做这个产品的时候，感觉像是给杭州的一封情书。\n\n每个路线，每个地标，都曾经留下过很多回忆。\n\n也偏心的加上了毛家埠，于谦祠，黛色参天。还有杭州特有的鸟叫，植物。\n\n还有历史中，那些人，那些事。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b0868f738389f5993fe5b45","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-27T01:14:31+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T02:09:17+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","display_name":"少楠Plidezus","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FmtwuafewTTtdX3XezBXlN2OsOvDv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false,"feed_order":6},{"id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2:https://m.okjike.com/reposts/6b086601320fd7e1b5871d37","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","source_name":"少楠Plidezus","title":"","summary":"刚做完保俶塔，还在想怎么把白塔做出来","body":"刚做完保俶塔，还在想怎么把白塔做出来","url":"https://m.okjike.com/reposts/6b086601320fd7e1b5871d37","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/lt-f6B-vgXjnEU3k6BGAazzb6nRZv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T01:01:53+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T02:09:17+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","display_name":"少楠Plidezus","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/lt-f6B-vgXjnEU3k6BGAazzb6nRZv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"}],"quote":{"handle":"BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","display_name":"刘飞Lufy","text":"钱弘俶的白塔，和钱弘佐的石像。\n\n闸门白塔是仅次于龙兴寺经幢的整个杭州地面古建里最老的东西，建于 957 年。就在钱塘江畔，是杭州近千年的交通地标。\n\n慈云寺石窟造像，建于 942 年，离白塔不远，就在玉皇山下。也是杭州最古老的造像之一，比多数飞来峰的造像要古。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/users/BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF"},"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FmtwuafewTTtdX3XezBXlN2OsOvDv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false,"feed_order":7},{"id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b078ec5136b2761c600f266","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","source_name":"少楠Plidezus","title":"","summary":"这是我一个没学过高数的人该看的东西么？","body":"这是我一个没学过高数的人该看的东西么？","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b078ec5136b2761c600f266","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/lhJyrpt4wLWyXje38MqlHaW__yqHv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T09:43:33+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T02:09:17+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","display_name":"少楠Plidezus","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/lhJyrpt4wLWyXje38MqlHaW__yqHv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FmtwuafewTTtdX3XezBXlN2OsOvDv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false,"feed_order":22},{"id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b050fef5bf736d2104a7e20","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","source_name":"少楠Plidezus","title":"","summary":"虽然是个步行模拟器，但是有很多启发都来自自小岛秀夫的《死亡搁浅》（太爱这个游戏） - 开场的镜头推拉，以及到地标的拉远镜头。 - 点击屏幕可以查看规划的路径，类似 Odradek 扫描效果。 - 可以异步联机，和其他人相遇。 - 走的路多了，会有一些痕迹。就像山里走出来的小路。 当然，任天堂的游戏也给了很多启发 - 风之杖的艺术风格 - 荒野之息的神庙密度安排和音效 - 动物森友会的现实时间系统和…","body":"虽然是个步行模拟器，但是有很多启发都来自自小岛秀夫的《死亡搁浅》（太爱这个游戏）\n\n- 开场的镜头推拉，以及到地标的拉远镜头。\n\n- 点击屏幕可以查看规划的路径，类似 Odradek 扫描效果。\n\n- 可以异步联机，和其他人相遇。\n\n- 走的路多了，会有一些痕迹。就像山里走出来的小路。\n\n当然，任天堂的游戏也给了很多启发\n\n- 风之杖的艺术风格\n\n- 荒野之息的神庙密度安排和音效\n\n- 动物森友会的现实时间系统和倒计时，以及换装系统\n\n有想内测的朋友么？","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b050fef5bf736d2104a7e20","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-24T12:17:51+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T02:09:17+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","display_name":"少楠Plidezus","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FmtwuafewTTtdX3XezBXlN2OsOvDv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false,"feed_order":46},{"id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b030290136b2761c686b45e","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","source_name":"少楠Plidezus","title":"","summary":"三体都 20 年了啊？？啊？ 所以柜子里的书也有 20 年了？","body":"三体都 20 年了啊？？啊？\n\n所以柜子里的书也有 20 年了？","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b030290136b2761c686b45e","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/lvOPa0LHutZFBDkSJUVGH19R_cK4v3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T22:56:16+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T02:09:17+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","display_name":"少楠Plidezus","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/lvOPa0LHutZFBDkSJUVGH19R_cK4v3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FmtwuafewTTtdX3